# Data notes

- Source: OECD AI patent indicators (Patent Cooperation Treaty applications).
- Period: 2010–2024. Earlier years use an older counting method and are excluded.
- Countries: United States, China, Japan, Korea, Germany, plus the world total (ALL) for shares.
- Shares = country count / ALL. Others = ALL minus the five countries.
- The ALL row does not exactly equal the sum of all countries in the source file.
